 {#if id==='replies'}<p>{lang==='zh'?'本課的 226 解讀適用於前後相符的正常 LIST／RETR 流程。RFC 959 也允許成功中止 ABOR 後回覆 226，因此單看這個數字不能證明整份檔案已傳完。請一起核對命令、先前回應、收到的資料與檔案大小／雜湊。':'The lesson interprets 226 in a matched, normal LIST/RETR sequence. RFC 959 also permits 226 after a successful ABOR, so the number alone does not prove the whole file arrived. Correlate the command, preceding replies, received data, size and hash.'} <a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc959.html#section-4.2.1">RFC 959</a></p>
